Package: hermit
Version: 1.0.0
Section: base
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libssl3 (>= 3.0), libcrypto3 (>= 3.0), libarchive13 (>= 3.4), libcurl4 (>= 7.68), libyaml-0-2 (>= 0.2.5)
Maintainer: Hermit Team <team@hermit.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/hermit/hermit
Description: Hermit - A lightweight container runtime with Docker-like CLI
 Hermit is a fast, secure, and lightweight container runtime that provides
 a complete container platform with Docker-compatible CLI. It features:
 .
  - Runtime with full namespace and cgroup support
  - Image building with layer caching and deduplication
  - Storage with overlayfs and volume management
  - Registry support with authentication and mirrors
  - Orchestration with compose file support
  - Security profiles and observability
 .
 This package contains the main hermit CLI tool and hermitd daemon.
EOF
